  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5ca3dc37bc93c41448ec7711e01fface, type: 3}
  m_Name: Doc_ScrapedPageChefDiary
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: CrimsonDraft.Navigation::CrimsonDraft.Navigation.Interactables.DocumentData
  title: Chef's Diary
  pages:
  - "I shouldn\u2019t have moved it. I kept it on me the entire time since I boarded,
    always within reach, always under control. It\u2019s small, almost ridiculous
    if you don\u2019t know what it is, but it holds more than something like this
    ever should. It\u2019s the only complete copy I have with me.\r\n\r\nI decided
    to hide it in the room. Not because it\u2019s safe, but because it\u2019s the
    only place she\u2019s almost never in. Vanessa spends more time in other people\u2019s
    beds than her own. That gave me a window. Or at least I thought it did. Now I\u2019m
    not so sure. Things are out of place. Small details, but enough. This isn\u2019t
    carelessness. She\u2019s looking."
  - "If she finds it, she won\u2019t be able to use it. Not without the code. Activation
    depends on the communicators, tied to a protocol that can\u2019t be replicated
    without authorized access. The procedure itself isn\u2019t complicated, you just
    have to\u2014"
